#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:13 fa1bc2065a66409b98c478e8d396877b
msgid ""
"Feb 02, 2016: Plane 3.5.0 released. Major Release including new Kalman "
"Filter (EKF2), Parachute Support, QuadPlane Support, Support for 4 new "
"Flight Boards *and lots more*. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-5-0-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2016 年 2 月 2 日：Plane 3.5.0 发布。重要版本，包括新的卡尔曼滤波器（EKF2）、降落伞支持、QuadPlane 支持、支持 4 "
"个新飞控板 *以及更多*。详情 `此处 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-"
"plane-3-5-0-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:17 b4ecdd292fa54228b7198a261829eb29
msgid ""
"Sept 24, 2015: Plane 3.4.0 released. Major Release including EKF by default,"
" more sensors, better logging, tuning, calibration. Last release to support "
"APM2.x. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-"
"plane-3-4-0-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2015 年 9 月 24 日：Plane 3.4.0 发布。重要版本，默认使用 EKF，更多传感器，更好的日志记录、调参、校准。最后支持 APM2.x"
" 的版本。详情 `此处 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-"
"plane-3-4-0-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:21 59318401267e46ee87ec98a578ed1678
msgid ""
"Sept 11, 2014: Plane 3.1.1 released. Mostly bug fixes. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-1-1-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2014 年 9 月 11 日：Plane 3.1.1 发布。主要为错误修复。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-1-1-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:23 7fe02e032de64312b6e7028d40ae3660
msgid ""
"Aug 25, 2014: Plane 3.1.0 released. Major release with many new features, "
"including terrain following, laser rangefinder support, and Linux support. "
"All details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-"
"plane-3-1-0-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2014 年 8 月 25 日：Plane 3.1.0 发布。重大版本，含许多新功能，包括地形跟随、激光测距仪支持和 Linux 支持。所有详情 `此处"
" <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-1-0-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:27 ab1f1c2bc9d245508810ae1ab8317560
msgid ""
"May 18, 2014: Plane 3.03 released. Bug fixes. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-0-3-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2014 年 5 月 18 日：Plane 3.03 发布。错误修复。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-0-3-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:29 911c6a2b985e4fcf9e8dc7142c63334d
msgid ""
"May 4, 2014: Plane 3.0.2 released. Fixed an important I2C bug and added "
"autotune."
msgstr "2014 年 5 月 4 日：Plane 3.0.2 发布。修复了一个重要的 I2C 错误并添加了自动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:30 33e1a6500de943d2a38cf45564594345
msgid ""
"April 7, 2014: Plane 3.0 released. Huge number of new features, including "
"Kalman filters, dual sensor support, RTK GPS and more. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-0-0-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2014 年 4 月 7 日：Plane 3.0 发布。大量新功能，包括卡尔曼滤波器、双传感器支持、RTK GPS 等。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-0-0-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:34 08f5bd93bc8e49e19bae64c92a3a6655
msgid ""
"Jan 29, 2014: Plane 2.78 released. Bug fixes. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-2-78-released>`__"
msgstr ""
"2014 年 1 月 29 日：Plane 2.78 发布。错误修复。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-2-78-released>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:36 48028f2e0429452b91b0b4e60513d868
msgid ""
"Jan 20, 2014: Plane 2.77 released. Many new features and enhanced support "
"for Pixhawk."
msgstr "2014 年 1 月 20 日：Plane 2.77 发布。许多新功能以及对 Pixhawk 的增强支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:38 df4d1484a99c4ba19bc5491de2671e7b
msgid ""
"November 5, 2013: Plane 2.76 released. Bug fixes and a few new features."
msgstr "2013 年 11 月 5 日：Plane 2.76 发布。错误修复和少量新功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:39 7902ceeefbc84ca0b7dda5aba628d08e
msgid ""
"October 28, 2013: Plane 2.75 released. New features, performance "
"improvements and bug fixes."
msgstr "2013 年 10 月 28 日：Plane 2.75 发布。新功能、性能改进和错误修复。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:40 9eaef5f0388545a8804631b780d3995f
msgid ""
"July 15, 2013: Plane 2.74 released. Significant performance improvements. "
"Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/apm-"
"plane-2-74-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2013 年 7 月 15 日：Plane 2.74 发布。显著的性能改进。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/apm-plane-2-74-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:42 1b24e7afad0a4e3493ed4daf850ab686
msgid ""
"June 2013: Plane codebase renamed Plane to reflect support of multiple "
"hardware platforms, including PX4"
msgstr "2013 年 6 月：代码库重命名为 Plane，以反映对多种硬件平台（包括 PX4）的支持"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:44 c3832016ba694968b2da5921ccc56c6f
msgid ""
"May 13, 2013: Plane 2.73 released. Bug fixes, GPS improvements and elevon "
"performance enhancements. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?xg_source=activity>`__."
msgstr ""
"2013 年 5 月 13 日：Plane 2.73 发布。错误修复、GPS 改进和升降副翼性能增强。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?xg_source=activity>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:47 5960eb09bb544b369de3072c8315a931
msgid ""
"April 28, 2013: Plane 2.72 released. Significant navigation improvements as "
"well as other performance enhancements and bug fixes. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-72-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2013 年 4 月 28 日：Plane 2.72 发布。重大导航改进以及其他性能增强和错误修复。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-72-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:51 149f26abdf4e4cb3908527244952be99
msgid ""
"April 5, 2013: Plane 2.71 released. Performance improvements, bug fixes and "
"new MAVLink features. See details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-71-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2013 年 4 月 5 日：Plane 2.71 发布。性能改进、错误修复和新的 MAVLink 功能。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-71-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:54 4617e40fd3354d82afe739e1392829cf
msgid ""
"Feb 20, 2013: Plane 2.70 released. Bug fixes, performance improvements and a"
" few new features including improved digicam control. More details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-70-released>`__"
msgstr ""
"2013 年 2 月 20 日：Plane 2.70 发布。错误修复、性能改进和一些新功能，包括改进的数码相机控制。更多详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-70-released>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:58 8dee441d82a04ca4a56be68d0be34753
msgid ""
"Feb 10, 2013: Plane 2.69 released. Includes new Training mode, support for "
"PX4 board, and improved performance. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-69-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2013 年 2 月 10 日：Plane 2.69 发布。包含新的 Training 模式、PX4 板支持和性能改进。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-69-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:61 cd5362ef87ff429fbee548824553f4a3
msgid ""
"Dec 3, 2012: Plane 2.68 released. Bug fixes and much improved sensor/DCM "
"processing for improved performance. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-68-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 12 月 3 日：Plane 2.68 发布。错误修复和大幅改进的传感器/DCM 处理以提高性能。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-68-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:64 140159468abf4a399818d9e081e0b3bc
msgid ""
"Nov 21, 2012: Plane 2.67 released. Bug fixes and new features. Details `here"
" <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-67-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 11 月 21 日：Plane 2.67 发布。错误修复和新功能。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-67-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:67 e096329ac97f48d48df57d038a89d75f
msgid ""
"Oct 30th, 2012: Plane 2.66 released. Bug fixes and feature additions. "
"Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-66-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 10 月 30 日：Plane 2.66 发布。错误修复和功能添加。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-66-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:70 366578309a8b4a94afdb4823aa294b22
msgid ""
"Sept 23, 2012: Plane 2.64/2.65 release. Bug fixes. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-65-released>`__ and `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-64-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 9 月 23 日：Plane 2.64/2.65 发布。错误修复。详情分别见 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-65-released>`__ 和 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-64-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:74 9c80d6ff89b54f908f0d5764b91f5f73
msgid ""
"Sept 17, 2012: Plane 2.63 released. Minor bug fixes, including one that had "
"caused resets if a GPS was not connected. Details `here "
"<http://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-63-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 9 月 17 日：Plane 2.63 发布。小错误修复，包括修复了在未连接 GPS 时可能导致重置的问题。详情 `此处 "
"<http://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-63-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:77 8bb0f94e702e4b4dad56c83a6b99e83d
msgid ""
"Sept 12, 2012: Plane 2.62 released. Minor bug fixes and performance "
"improvements. Details `here "
"<http://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-62-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 9 月 12 日：Plane 2.62 发布。小错误修复和性能改进。详情 `此处 "
"<http://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-62-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:80 a7ffe1c9e7954d3eb5d359175df28851
msgid ""
"Sept 9. 2012: Plane 2.61 released. Bug fixes and performance enhancements, "
"which are all described `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-61-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 9 月 9 日：Plane 2.61 发布。错误修复和性能增强，均在 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-61-released>`__ 有描述。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:83 a03480f5447647dd91ff923159e154a8
msgid ""
"August 22, 2012: Plane 2.60 released. Bug fixes (including one on the "
"dataflash erasing) and performance improvements. Main new features in this "
"release are: wind estimation; long term dead reckoning support; wheeled "
"takeoff and landing support; optional new roll/pitch/yaw controllers. "
"Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-60-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 8 月 22 日：Plane 2.60 "
"发布。错误修复（包括数据闪存擦除问题）和性能改进。此版本的主要新功能为：风速估计、长期航位推测支持、轮式起降支持、可选新型横滚/俯仰/偏航控制器。详情 "
"`此处 <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-60-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:89 99f8e9fd0caa46699785fcf55d7aafc5
msgid ""
"July 25, 2012: Plane 2.50 released. Improvement include improved DCM "
"performance, waypoint logic and altitude control. Bug fixes include "
"dataflash erasing, some missing MAVLink parameters and navigation roll "
"control. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-50-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 7 月 25 日：Plane 2.50 发布。改进包括 DCM 性能改进、航点逻辑和高度控制。错误修复包括数据闪存擦除、一些缺失的 "
"MAVLink 参数和导航横滚控制。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-50-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:94 598fe10f42ca4f5485761cc5248bcb35
msgid ""
"June 15, 2012: Plane 2.40 released. Supports MAVLink 1.0, new 3DR Ublox GPS "
"module, improved dataflash erase to ensure fast startup on first use, fixed "
"an elevon reverse bug in the setup process. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-40-beta>`__ and `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-40-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 6 月 15 日：Plane 2.40 发布。支持 MAVLink 1.0、新的 3DR Ublox GPS "
"模块、改进的数据闪存擦除以确保首次使用时快速启动、修复了设置过程中的升降副翼反向错误。详情分别见 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-40-beta>`__ 和 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-40-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:100 f01d81893f554454ae482bbfe3bfddf7
msgid ""
"May 13, 2012: Plane 2.34 released. Fixes a bug that affected some APM 2 "
"boards with a slightly rev of the MPU-6000 sensor. Adds support for MAVLink "
"1.0. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-34-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 5 月 13 日：Plane 2.34 发布。修复了影响某些带有略微修订的 MPU-6000 传感器的 APM 2 板的错误。添加了对 "
"MAVLink 1.0 的支持。详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-34-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:104 0a7c0ea2023a49d8b1b4a3551c0a41ac
msgid ""
"April 9, 2012: Plane 2.33 released. Compass declination can now be set "
"automatically. Includes MAVLink improvements optimized for new 3DR radios."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 4 月 9 日：Plane 2.33 发布。罗盘偏角现在可以自动设置。包含针对新 3DR 无线电优化的 MAVLink 改进。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:107 ac668b7591be4f5e8c6f8b52e83c6d24
msgid ""
"March 28, 2012: Plane 2.32 released. Includes some compass and baro sensor "
"improvements. Full description `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-32-released?>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 3 月 28 日：Plane 2.32 发布。包含一些罗盘和气压传感器改进。完整描述 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-32-released?>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:110 f712ae7cdb3440c1bb509456e0344c82
msgid ""
"March 17, 2012: Plane 2.30 released. Much improved DCM and compass code for "
"better stability and navigation performance. Many other bug fixes. Full "
"description in the release post `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-30-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 3 月 17 日：Plane 2.30 发布。大幅改进的 DCM "
"和罗盘代码，以提高稳定性和导航性能。许多其他错误修复。发布帖子中的完整描述 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-30-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:114 d08ef9e6095d4f5e837e85ea13bf85b6
msgid ""
"Jan 16, 2012: Plane 2.28 released. Improved compatibility with APM 2, "
"including support for airspeed and battery-monitoring sensors. Some bug "
"fixes on compass and datalogging."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 1 月 16 日：Plane 2.28 发布。改进了与 APM 2 "
"的兼容性，包括对空速和电池监测传感器的支持。对罗盘和数据记录的一些错误修复。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:117 fb6ac77c52604b498265e216e919e1af
msgid ""
"Dec 20, 2011: Plane 2.27 released. Adds geofencing function, improved "
"datalogging and filesystem, faster MAVLink starts."
msgstr "2011 年 12 月 20 日：Plane 2.27 发布。添加地理围栏功能、改进的数据记录和文件系统、更快的 MAVLink 启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:119 ed7f2e711aad46a89278bd344be8716d
msgid ""
"Nov 19, 2011: Plane 2.26 released. Log files will now overwrite from the "
"beginning of the memory when the dataflash is full (before, logging would "
"halt when memory was full until you manually cleared the logs)."
msgstr ""
"2011 年 11 月 19 日：Plane 2.26 "
"发布。当数据闪存满时，日志文件现在将从内存开头开始覆盖（以前，日志记录在内存满时会停止，直到手动清除日志）。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:123 ae16bb636c3e4d22b0cc668d643cebd1
msgid ""
"Nov 13, 2011: Plane 2.25 released. Bug fixes, plus changes to mission "
"structure so that conditional and immediate commands are located between "
"associated waypoints instead of after the second waypoint."
msgstr ""
"2011 年 11 月 13 日：Plane 2.25 发布。错误修复，以及对任务结构的更改，使条件命令和即时命令位于相关航点之间，而非第二个航点之后。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:126 d7cb8e9dfdf84fb4abc467dbc5efe930
msgid ""
"Sept 8, 2011: Plane 2.24 released. Mostly bug fixes, including fixes to "
"avoid memory overruns and EEPROM corruption. Also includes a few new "
"features, including improved MAVline comms, improves Crosstrack correction, "
"code to avoid Xbee bricking, improved use of the temperature sensor in "
"barometric sensor reading, etc."
msgstr ""
"2011 年 9 月 8 日：Plane 2.24 发布。主要为错误修复，包括避免内存溢出和 EEPROM 损坏的修复。还包含一些新功能，包括改进的 "
"MAVLink 通信、改进的横迹修正、防止 Xbee 变砖的代码、改进气压计读数中的温度传感器使用等。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:131 bf5258a0debf46169051ac3b440b0888
msgid ""
"August 25, 2011: Plane 2.23 released. Includes differential aileron/flap "
"functionality. Corrected AIRSPD2PTCH_IMAX Mavlink parameter to work in GCSs."
" Fixed condition_change_alt command to handle decents properly"
msgstr ""
"2011 年 8 月 25 日：Plane 2.23 发布。包含差动副翼/襟翼功能。修正了 GCS 中的 AIRSPD2PTCH_IMAX "
"MAVLink 参数。修复了 condition_change_alt 命令以正确处理下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:135 020ddbc7cb68413896cdb9da6931d7a9
msgid ""
"August 15, 2011: APM 2.22 released. Many small improvements, including: "
"MAVLink startup is now much faster and will work even if the hardware fails "
"the calibration test. 5883 magnetometer bug fixed. Various (mostly minor) "
"navigation bugs fixed. MAVLink comms improved."
msgstr ""
"2011 年 8 月 15 日：APM 2.22 发布。许多小改进，包括：MAVLink 启动现在快得多，即使硬件校准测试失败也能工作。修复了 5883"
" 磁力计错误。修复了各种（大多为次要的）导航错误。改进了 MAVLink 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:139 80da5fe51fc342d081457fc3e64b8e76
msgid ""
"July 3, 2011: APM 2.20 released. Now supports the new `standard magnetometer"
" using the HMC5883L chip "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/APM2_6_Compass_HMC5883_p/jdmagnet001.htm>`__, "
"which is autodetected. Also fixes problem with airspeed sensor autodetection"
" in some setups. For now, to enable your airspeed sensor via the Mission "
"Planner Configuration screen. Change the AIRSPD_ENABLE value to 1 to enable,"
" then click \"Write PIDs\" to save. You can check that it's enabled "
"correctly with the CLI Test \"airspeed\"."
msgstr ""
"2011 年 7 月 3 日：APM 2.20 发布。现在支持新的 `使用 HMC5883L 芯片的标准磁力计 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/APM2_6_Compass_HMC5883_p/jdmagnet001.htm>`__，可自动检测。还修复了某些设置中的空速传感器自动检测问题。目前，要通过"
" Mission Planner 配置屏幕启用空速传感器，请将 AIRSPD_ENABLE 值更改为 1 以启用，然后点击「Write "
"PIDs」保存。您可以通过 CLI 测试「airspeed」验证是否正确启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:146 ebff7eccb1214c1580cc03d284b17240
msgid ""
"June 9, 2011: Gorgeous new Mission Planner version (1.0) released, with a "
"new Guided mode for real time \"go here now\" commands. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/introducing-a-new-apm-feature>`__."
msgstr ""
"2011 年 6 月 9 日：发布精美的新 Mission Planner 版本（1.0），带有新的 Guided "
"模式，可实现实时「立即飞往此处」命令。详情 `此处 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/introducing-"
"a-new-apm-feature>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:149 c9f8220d23f54077b0d627bd3b761a45
msgid ""
"May 2, 2011: APM 2.1 is released, which takes the 2.x project out of beta. "
"Release details are `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-2-out-"
"of-beta>`__. The manual, Mission Planner and HK GCS have all been updated "
"for APM 2.x."
msgstr ""
"2011 年 5 月 2 日：APM 2.1 发布，将 2.x 项目从测试版中发布。发布详情 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-2-out-of-beta>`__。手册、Mission "
"Planner 和 HK GCS 均已针对 APM 2.x 更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:153 d6a62e0f59624064ba1b9f3c7f89d81a
msgid ""
"March 11, 2011; First APM 2.x beta released. This is a major update, "
"including MAVLink-based telemetry, mission planning and two-way "
"communications. Details in the announcement post `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-20-beta-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2011 年 3 月 11 日；发布首个 APM 2.x 测试版。这是一次重大更新，包括基于 MAVLink 的数传、任务规划和双向通信。详情见公告帖 "
"`此处 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-20-beta-released>`__。"
